Package: clonoloom
Type: Package
Title: Reviewed Local Automation of 'ClonoLoom'
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("Robert", "McDermott", email = "robert.c.mcdermott@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Drives the normal local 'ClonoLoom' repertoire analysis host using
    generated actions, explicit permissions and human proposal review. Preserves
    exact JSON number tokens and original evidence without numeric conversion.
    Scientific computations remain in the host, with no client-side estimator.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/clonoloom
BugReports: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/clonoloom/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: curl (>= 8.0.0), jsonlite (>= 2.0.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0), withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
